# the master EQ: MIX's third row (LFO, LFO), the gains on the three knobs, HOME + knobs their frequencies
wait 300
tap LFO
wait 100
tap LFO
wait 100
tap LFO
wait 600
expect page 3
shot eq_flat.png
tap PLAY
spin SELECT 4
spin ALGO -3
spin PRESET 5
wait 900
shot eq_set.png
press HOME
spin SELECT -20
spin ALGO 15
wait 100
spin PRESET 30
wait 300
shot eq_freq.png
release HOME
wait 2000
expect voices >0
spin SELECT -4
spin ALGO 3
spin PRESET -5
wait 600
shot eq_flat_again.png
tap PLAY
